#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
forebo-install - host-side installer/translator for the ForeB UEFI bootloader.

Reads an existing bootloader configuration on the EFI System Partition (ESP):
  * Limine   (limine.conf / limine.cfg, new-style format)   - primary, exact
  * GRUB     (grub/grub.cfg)                                 - best-effort
  * systemd-boot (loader/loader.conf + loader/entries/*.conf)
and translates it 1:1 into ForeB's \\forebo\\forebo.cfg format, then can
optionally install ForeB ALONGSIDE the current bootloader (never replacing
it) and register a UEFI boot entry with efibootmgr.

Commands:
    scan        auto-detect + parse configs on the ESP, print a report
    generate    print the translated forebo.cfg to stdout (or --output FILE)
    install     full install (root required; --dry-run to preview)
    --selftest  run internal offline tests against tools/tests/ fixtures

Stdlib only (python3 >= 3.8).  PIL/Pillow is used for wallpaper conversion
when importable, otherwise a built-in minimal PNG decoder is used.
"""

